note: Found by the 2026-06-12 computer-use real-GUI test (real test beats
review, again): key successfully saved to Keychain under deepseek-api (verified
independently via security find-generic-password), but SystemFacilitatorProbe
defaulted to the LEGACY constant MetaAIConfig.defaultCredentialScope
(meta_ai_api_key) — a saved key was invisible to the probe and the app would
stay degraded even after restart. Fix: probe default scope =
MetaAIConfigStore.load().credentialScope (the current config is the truth;
user-saved custom configs are followed too). One semantic line + 1 test.
254 tests total, MIN_TESTS raised.
